														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1963864">
									

<blockquote>
<p>In later stages of the disease the severity of the anomalous symptoms increase, leading to an inability to process external sounds, a loss of the ability to cogitate&#8230; and finally death</p>
</blockquote>
<p>They can't keep him around very long, then, because pretty soon he's going to perceive nothing but the meme and then die. Seems like it would be better if he wrote it down or, i dunno, hummed it into a recorder if you need it for later comparisons. Then you amnesticize him and release. If it's recorded, it's more ethical, easier to contain, and above all else <span style="text-decoration: underline;">cheaper</span>.</p>

							</div>

								
					
